    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to New Jersey Drone Simulator! Step into the pilot\u2019s seat and command the famous New Jersey drone squadron in a battle against an otherworldly invasion. Effectively manage your drone squad, survive the alien onslaught, and save the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Drone Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control isn\u2019t just about flying\u2014it\u2019s about strategy. Seamlessly switch between your drones to bring various weapon platforms into position.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missile Platform:</strong> Lock onto and intercept incoming alien projectiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Platform:</strong> Eliminate enemy laser turrets with pinpoint precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Carrier:</strong> Deploy explosives to dismantle alien strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/f93f2bc7df8f44476928386e4994dfee.poster.avif?t=1740973439\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/f93f2bc7df8f44476928386e4994dfee.webm?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/f93f2bc7df8f44476928386e4994dfee.mp4?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Mission: Recover the Nukes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens have stolen three nukes,  it\u2019s up to you to recover them. Locate, retrieve, and safely deliver each nuke back to base under relentless enemy fire.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locate:</strong> Navigate through dangerous zones to track down the missing nukes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retrieve:</strong> Utilize your drone squad\u2019s diverse abilities to clear the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return:</strong> Fly back to base while fending off relentless alien attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/a12433390e02514f9d32a18baa37292c.poster.avif?t=1740973439\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/a12433390e02514f9d32a18baa37292c.webm?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/a12433390e02514f9d32a18baa37292c.mp4?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront the Alien Menace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invaders are relentless and their technology is formidable. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Projectiles:</strong> Dodge or neutralize high-speed attacks with your missile platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Turrets:</strong> Strategically disable enemy firepower using your gun platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Assaults:</strong> Adapt quickly as multiple threats converge on your position.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/ee3aeaa563af81f489fe005a0fa61b62.poster.avif?t=1740973439\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/ee3aeaa563af81f489fe005a0fa61b62.webm?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/ee3aeaa563af81f489fe005a0fa61b62.mp4?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Multitasking for Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in New Jersey Drone Simulator relies on your ability to multitask and strategize:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the Right Weapons:</strong> Adapt to evolving threats by picking-up different weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan &amp; Execute:</strong> Balance offense and defense in real-time, ensuring that each drone fulfills its role.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Coordination:</strong> Combine the unique strengths of your squad to overcome seemingly insurmountable odds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/6afb91adb4e4c47e60a90b2bbfbaa600.poster.avif?t=1740973439\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/6afb91adb4e4c47e60a90b2bbfbaa600.webm?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443470/extras/6afb91adb4e4c47e60a90b2bbfbaa600.mp4?t=1740973439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And remember kids, only YOU can prevent alien invasions!</strong></p>",
